values
  ('336a0121-bb51-47b7-8125-a40673d53a77', 'traits', '{"name":"Adrenaline Rush","desc":"You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action. When you do so, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.\nYou can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest."}'::jsonb, '{"index":"adrenaline-rush","url":"/api/2024/traits/adrenaline-rush","name":"Adrenaline Rush","description":"You can take the Dash action as a Bonus Action. When you do so, you gain a number of Temporary Hit Points equal to your Proficiency Bonus.\nYou can use this trait a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Short or Long Rest.","species":[{"index":"orc","url":"/api/2024/species/orc","name":"Orc"}]}'::jsonb),
  ('336a0121-bb51-47b7-8125-a40673d53a77', 'traits', '{"name":"Brave","desc":"You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Frightened condition."}'::jsonb, '{"index":"brave","url":"/api/2024/traits/brave","name":"Brave","description":"You have Advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the Frightened condition.","species":[{"index":"halfling","url":"/api/2024/species/halfling","name":"Halfling"}]}'::jsonb),
  ('336a0121-bb51-47b7-8125-a40673d53a77', 'traits', '{"name":"Breath Weapon: Acid","desc":"When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 acid damage. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\nYou can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest."}'::jsonb, '{"index":"draconic-breath-weapon-acid","url":"/api/2024/traits/draconic-breath-weapon-acid","name":"Breath Weapon: Acid","description":"When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 acid damage. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\nYou can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.","species":[{"index":"dragonborn","url":"/api/2024/species/dragonborn","name":"Dragonborn"}],"subspecies":[{"index":"draconic-ancestor-black","url":"/api/2024/subspecies/draconic-ancestor-black","name":"Draconic Ancestor: Black"},{"index":"draconic-ancestor-copper","url":"/api/2024/subspecies/draconic-ancestor-copper","name":"Draconic Ancestor: Copper"}]}'::jsonb),
  ('336a0121-bb51-47b7-8125-a40673d53a77', 'traits', '{"name":"Breath Weapon: Cold","desc":"When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 cold damage. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\nYou can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest."}'::jsonb, '{"index":"draconic-breath-weapon-cold","url":"/api/2024/traits/draconic-breath-weapon-cold","name":"Breath Weapon: Cold","description":"When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 cold damage. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\nYou can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.","species":[{"index":"dragonborn","url":"/api/2024/species/dragonborn","name":"Dragonborn"}],"subspecies":[{"index":"draconic-ancestor-silver","url":"/api/2024/subspecies/draconic-ancestor-silver","name":"Draconic Ancestor: Silver"},{"index":"draconic-ancestor-white","url":"/api/2024/subspecies/draconic-ancestor-white","name":"Draconic Ancestor: White"}]}'::jsonb),
